{"id":70271,"date":"2025-10-25T11:00:37","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T10:00:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70271"},"modified":"2026-10-19T23:39:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T22:39:30","slug":"ameal-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ameal-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Ameal Trail Meivcore 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ameal Trail Meivcore 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Ameal Trail Meivcore 2027<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>10 e 11 de abril de 2027<\/strong> na aldeia do <strong>Ameal<\/strong> (Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Taveiro, Ameal e Arzila), no concelho e distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Com partida e chegada no <strong>Campo de Futebol do Ameal<\/strong> (Polidesportiva do Ameal), o programa inicia-se no s\u00e1bado, 10 de abril, \u00e0s <strong>16:30<\/strong> com o <strong>Ameal Trail Kids<\/strong> e prossegue no domingo, 11 de abril, com as partidas do <strong>Trail Curto 17 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, do <strong>Mini-Trail 11 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> e da <strong>Caminhada 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:40<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Inserido nas paisagens florestais do baixo vale do <strong>Mondego<\/strong>, junto \u00e0 reserva natural do <strong>Paul de Arzila<\/strong>, o percurso principal de <strong>17,5 km<\/strong> soma <strong>763 m D+<\/strong> e integra o <strong>Circuito Distrital de Trail Running de Coimbra (ADAC)<\/strong>, enquanto o <strong>Mini-Trail de 11 km<\/strong> apresenta <strong>567 m D+<\/strong>. A prova decorre em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia (com apito, manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel e recipiente m\u00ednimo de 250 ml obrigat\u00f3rios), contando com 2 abastecimentos interm\u00e9dios nos 17 km e 1 nos 11 km e caminhada, al\u00e9m do abastecimento final.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>ARDA &#8211; Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Desportiva do Ameal<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Taveiro, Ameal e Arzila<\/strong> e a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Coimbra<\/strong>, o evento inclui no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro, banhos e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio completo (caldo verde, bifana e bebida), culminando \u00e0s <strong>12:30<\/strong> de domingo com a entrega de pr\u00e9mios ao Top 3 geral M\/F, escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios, 3 melhores equipas M\/F e equipa mais numerosa. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 a 11 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Campo de Futebol do Ameal (Polidesportiva do Ameal), Coimbra<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(2