\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa e 2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 7,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 26\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Ameal Trail Meivcore 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no fim de semana de 10 e 11 de abril de 2027, com partida e chegada no Campo de Futebol do Ameal (Polidesportiva do Ameal), no concelho de Coimbra. No s\u00e1bado, 10 de abril, decorre o Trail Kids a partir das 16:30; no domingo, 11 de abril, partem o Trail 17 km (09:00), o Mini-Trail 11 km (09:30) e a Caminhada 10 km (09:40).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 3 fases (at\u00e9 01\/12\/2026, at\u00e9 28\/02\/2027 e at\u00e9 26\/03\/2027): Trail Curto 17 km (19 \u20ac, 20 \u20ac e 22 \u20ac, com desconto de 1,50 \u20ac para atletas filiados na ADAC), Mini-Trail 11 km (15 \u20ac, 16 \u20ac e 17 \u20ac), Caminhada 10 km (14 \u20ac, 15 \u20ac e 16 \u20ac) e Trail Kids (5 \u20ac, 5 \u20ac e 7 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro, abastecimentos, transporte para a meta em caso de desist\u00eancia, banhos e almo\u00e7o final (caldo verde, uma bifana e fino\/\u00e1gua\/sumo). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel operacional e recipiente para l\u00edquidos com m\u00ednimo de 250 ml.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Campo de Futebol do Ameal no s\u00e1bado, 10 de abril, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, 11 de abril, a partir das 07:30 (encerrando \u00e0s 08:45 para os 17 km e \u00e0s 09:15 para os 11 km e Caminhada).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o desn\u00edvel acumulado dos percursos e que pr\u00e9mios s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Curto (17,5 km) soma 763 m de desn\u00edvel positivo (D+) e o Mini-Trail (11 km) conta com 567 m D+. Na cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio \u00e0s 12:30 de domingo s\u00e3o premiados os 3 primeiros da geral M\/F, os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Sub-18 a M\/F70), as 3 melhores equipas M\/F e a equipa mais numerosa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ameal Trail Meivcore 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-10\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Campo de Futebol do Ameal (Polidesportiva do Ameal), Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"ARDA - Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Desportiva do Ameal\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": []}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70272,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,624,22,497,739],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-70271","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-coimbra","event_type-caminhada","event_type-kids","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-kids-trail","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-ameal-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70271","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=70271"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70271\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70274,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70271\/revisions\/70274"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70272"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=70271"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":tru